- Are you still doing the whole art thing?
- What do you mean?

15:13.840 --> 15:17.719
I mean, that thing you used to do
with the art.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.598
And the poetry.

15:20.080 --> 15:22.355
Milly, did Jake tell you
he was in a band?

15:22.520 --> 15:23.748
Yeah, I'm in a band.

15:26.680 --> 15:28.796
I don't think she has low self-esteem.

15:32.600 --> 15:34.875
Shall we take care of business
before we get started?

15:35.040 --> 15:38.271
Oh, absolutely. No money, no honey.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.477
No looty, no booty.

15:43.240 --> 15:45.708
No cash advance,
I'm not in your pants.

15:48.080 --> 15:50.150
- That was 400, right?
- Five.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.514
Oh, of course.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.398
Why do I think it was four?

15:56.400 --> 16:01.235
Thanks. So, Alan, what do you like?

16:01.400 --> 16:03.595
Oh, just about anything.
I'm not finicky.

16:04.880 --> 16:06.154
No limits, huh?

16:06.320 --> 16:11.678
Well, you know, I'm not into animals
or anything near my keister.

16:12.480 --> 16:15.392
Okay, come here.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.834
Let's get comfy.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.638
Oh, alrighty.

16:21.240 --> 16:24.835
Baby, you really turn me on.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.956
- Hang on a sec.
- What?

16:27.120 --> 16:30.078
I'm a little bumped
by that "turn me on" part.

16:30.240 --> 16:32.674
I wanna believe you,
but I've been with enough women...

16:32.840 --> 16:34.831
...to know that it doesn't happen
that fast.

16:36.360 --> 16:38.032
Sometimes it doesn't happen at all.

16:38.200 --> 16:40.634
Honey, I would not lie to you.

16:40.800 --> 16:42.836
No, no, of course not.
Why would you lie to me?

16:43.000 --> 16:47.516
But I'm just saying it would help...

16:47.680 --> 16:51.593
...if you could tone down the narration
to a more believable level.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.193
- All right.
- Okay.

16:56.720 --> 16:59.439
You are the best kisser.

16:59.600 --> 17:02.034
- Okay, again.
- What?

17:02.200 --> 17:04.953
I happen to know for a fact
that I'm not the best kisser.

17:05.120 --> 17:06.758
Okay, I'm a little confused here.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.514
I'm just not buying it.

17:08.680 --> 17:11.752
And since I am buying it,
I should be able to buy it.

17:13.240 --> 17:16.596
All you have to do is tell the truth.
There's no need for hyperbole.

17:17.200 --> 17:19.395
- All right, okay.
- Okay.

17:20.160 --> 17:24.472
Oh, Alan, your lips are so...

17:24.640 --> 17:27.154
...thin and dry.

17:29.160 --> 17:31.196
Okay, now we're cooking.

17:33.080 --> 17:34.991
I think competitive eating
really changed...

17:35.160 --> 17:37.833
...when that Japanese guy
started wetting the hot-dog buns.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.831
I actually figured out that trick myself.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.194
By accident.

17:43.280 --> 17:45.669
So how are your folks doing?

17:45.840 --> 17:46.989
That's not funny, Charlie.

17:47.160 --> 17:51.676
You know, I meant,
how are they doing in heaven?

17:52.200 --> 17:54.509
- What are you talking about?
- Hell?

17:55.400 --> 17:56.958
Are you referring to their divorce?

17:57.120 --> 18:00.476
Yes, I am, and divorce is hell.
But after a while, it can be like heaven.

18:00.640 --> 18:03.029
You know, you're even prettier
than I remember.

18:03.200 --> 18:06.351
Thank you. And you are just as charming
as the first time we met.

18:06.520 --> 18:08.556
- Oh, you don't remember that.
- I sure do.

18:08.720 --> 18:12.156
- It was a really hot day in July...
- Hot dog eaters are amateurs.

18:12.320 --> 18:15.869
The guys that do pork ribs and spaghetti,
they're the real athletes.

18:17.120 --> 18:19.429
Hey, hey, hey, the lady's talking here.

18:19.600 --> 18:23.070
Oh, right. Milly, Charlie wants to know
what your mom's name is.

18:24.960 --> 18:26.439
You don't remember my name?

18:26.600 --> 18:28.670
What? Of course I do.

18:28.840 --> 18:30.796
You're gonna listen
to SpongeBob SmearPants?

18:32.840 --> 18:37.277
Oh, you wanna play like that, huh,
Mr. Drunky Face.

18:37.960 --> 18:39.951
- What's my name, Charlie?
- Just a sec.

18:40.120 --> 18:42.031
How's your lobster?
Do you need more butter?

18:42.200 --> 18:44.236
Because there's plenty on Jake's shirt.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.237
You have no idea
what my name is, do you?

18:47.400 --> 18:49.118
He doesn't have a clue.

18:49.280 --> 18:51.919
Okay, okay, okay,
I'm not good with names.

18:52.080 --> 18:55.038
But I'll never forget the passionate nights
we spent together.

18:55.200 --> 18:57.395
- We never spent the night together.
- We didn't?

18:57.560 --> 19:00.154
- No.
- Well, no wonder I don't remember you.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.592
Come on, honey, we're leaving.

19:02.760 --> 19:04.876
No, no, no, wait, wait, wait.

19:05.040 --> 19:06.189
I gotta know.

19:06.360 --> 19:08.271
Who the hell are you?

19:09.520 --> 19:11.238
- Nice going.
- Me?

19:11.400 --> 19:14.358
- You're putting this on me?
- Can I bring you anything else?

19:14.800 --> 19:19.191
Yeah, get me a bottle of Scotch,
a taxi and a smarter kid.

19:19.600 --> 19:21.795
Can I have
a chocolate mousse, please?

19:24.960 --> 19:29.636
Oh, come on, I just said I can't believe
I'm the biggest you've ever seen.

19:29.800 --> 19:32.268
I mean, I'm not even the biggest
I've ever seen.

19:33.000 --> 19:35.753
- And I haven't seen that many.
- I'm sorry, I have to go.

19:35.920 --> 19:37.478
- Why?
- I have a headache.

19:37.640 --> 19:39.835
I can work with that.
I was married for 12 years.

19:40.000 --> 19:42.833
Here's your money.
Don't ever call me again.

19:47.800 --> 19:49.438
Okay, second base for free.

20:08.720 --> 20:12.030
So are either of you gonna tell me
how it went tonight?

20:12.200 --> 20:13.997
Ask your bubble-headed son.

20:14.160 --> 20:16.355
Ask your butt-headed brother.

20:17.120 --> 20:18.269
You know what?

20:18.440 --> 20:19.873
I'm not that interested.

20:20.040 --> 20:21.109
I'm going to bed.

20:22.520 --> 20:23.953
Oh, no, stay.

20:24.120 --> 20:26.395
I so enjoy your company.

20:29.960 --> 20:31.996
So how'd it go with Alexis?

20:32.520 --> 20:37.116
Well, I don't wanna brag,
but she wouldn't take my money.

21:03.760 --> 21:05.751
Subtitles by
SDI Media Group

21:05.920 --> 21:07.911
[ENGLISH]
